immers, body groomers, nose and ear trimmers, women's shavers, and haircut kits. It sells its products under the Good'n'Fun, Good Boy, DreamBone, Nature's Miracle, SmartBones, FURminator, Wild HarvestTM, 8IN1, Dingo, Better Belly, Meowee!, Eukanuba, IAMS, Tetra, Marineland, GloFish, Instant Ocean, OmegaSea, Hot Shot, Black Flag, Spectracide, Liquid Fence, Garden Safe, Cutter, and Remington brands through brick-and-mortar retail channels, e-commerce channels, wholesalers, and distributors. Spectrum Brands Holdings, Inc. was founded in 1906 and is based in Middleton, Wisconsin.","employees":2800,"website":"https://www.spectrumbrands.com","country":"United States","city":"Middleton","officers":[{"name":"Mr. David M. Maura C.F.A.","title":"Executive Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Faisal  Qadir","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Ehsan  Zargar","title":"Executive VP, General Counsel & Corporate Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":14.87,"tpe":20.28,"ps":1.142,"pfcf":17.86,"peg":1.655,"pb":2.597,"ev_ebitda":10.63,"rev_growth":0.039,"eps_growth":0.1415,"eps_growth_fwd":0.07,"eps_growth_next":0.0742,"div_yield":0.0206,"roe":0.1246,"roa":0.05646,"de":80.63,"gross_margin":0.3557,"op_margin":0.112,"profit_margin":0.0447,"current_ratio":1.279},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":12.68,"sector":14.87,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":35.83,"sector":20.28,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":0.6369,"sector":1.142,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":8.831,"sector":17.86,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.36,"sector":1.655,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":0.9699,"sector":2.597,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":38.71,"sector":80.63,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":-0.028,"sector":0.039,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":-0.5